---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import podcast from '../../assets/img/skv_podcast.jpeg';
---

<Section id="beyond">
  <div class="beyond">
    <div class="coaching">
      <h2>Away from the screen</h2>
      <p>
        For eight years, a lot of my evenings belonged to <a
          href="https://www.skvflorbal.cz/">Sokol Královské Vinohrady</a
        >. I started as an assistant with the men's team, coached for a few
        months in Slovenia during Erasmus, then came back to lead the juniors.
        Eventually, I became head coach of the men's Superliga team.
      </p>
      <p>
        We reached the best results in the club's history with a young team.
        Some of the juniors I coached were now playing for the seniors. That was
        the most satisfying part of the journey.
      </p>
      <a href="/coaching/">A few years on the sidelines</a>
    </div>
    <div class="personal">
      <p>
        Outside the sports hall, I enjoy mountains, travelling, psychology and
        epic fantasy. For a film recommendation, there’s always <a
          href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Princess_Bride_(film)"
          >The Princess Bride</a
        >.
      </p>
      <a
        class="podcast"
        href="https://www.skvflorbal.cz/c/skvely-podcast-2-miroslav-purkrabek-2430"
      >
        <Image
          src={podcast}
          alt="SKV podcast with Mira Purkrábek"
          width={88}
          height={88}
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <span
          ><strong>A conversation about floorball</strong><small
            >SKV podcast · in Czech</small
          ></span
        >
      </a>
      <a href="/about/">More about me</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
<style>
  .beyond {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .beyond > div > a {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  .personal {
    padding-top: 2.65rem;
  }
  .podcast {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-block: 1.2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .podcast :global(img) {
    width: 70px;
    height: 70px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .podcast strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .podcast small {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .beyond {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .personal {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
